    "서울시는 노동자의 권익을 보호하고 일터에서의 알 권리를 보장하기 위해 「2026년 노동자 권익보호 안내서」(e-book)를 제작·발간하였습니다.📖 안내서 개요제목: 2026년 노동권리 안내서(e-book)제작 종류: 3종 6편, 4개 언어① 서울시민 노동권리안내서② 청소년 노동권리안내서③ 외국인 근로자 노동권리안내서 (한국어·영어·중국어·베트남어)📌 주요 내용- 2026년 개정 노동법 및 근로기준법 핵심 사항- 모성보호 및 일·가정 양립 지원 제도- 산업안전보건법·중대재해처벌법 적용사항- 5인 미만 사업장 법령 준수 가이드- 부록: 노동법령 위반 시 벌칙 규정, 주요 노동 상담 기관·연락처서울시민 노동권리안내서 바로가기 : https://ebook.seoul.go.kr/Viewer/Q0J6AB40Y77E청소년 노동권리안내서 바로가기 : https://ebook.seoul.go.kr/Viewer/5AD5J1YB88RT외국인근로자 노동권리안내서 바로가기(국문) : https://ebook.seoul.go.kr/Viewer/EV6S6IY5PS1OHandbook on the Labor Rights : https://ebook.seoul.go.kr/Viewer/YPMIUZSKTTT2劳动权益手册 : https://ebook.seoul.go.kr/Viewer/HBR89ZM8INIKSổ Tay Quyền Lao Động của Người Lao Động Nước Ngoài : https://ebook.seoul.go.kr/Viewer/7AR7GNCIJ5F3": 1,
    "📢 폭염 대비! 온열질환 예방수칙 외국어 모음집 안내여름철 폭염은 누구에게나 위험할 수 있습니다. 특히 언어 장벽으로 인해 정보를 얻기 어려운 외국인들을 위해 온열질환 예방수칙을 19개 언어로 번역한 모음집을 제작했습니다.📖 모음집 구성 언어한국어, 영어, 네팔어, 동티모르어, 라오스어, 몽골어, 미얀마어, 방글라데시어, 베트남어, 스리랑카어, 우즈베키스탄어, 인도네시아어, 중국어, 캄보디아어, 키르기스스탄어, 타지키스탄어, 태국어, 파키스탄어, 필리핀(타갈로그어)": 1,
    "<img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260724145213d756dceb-9b18-4a73-b960-e624c157d5b3.png\" alt=\"Do not worry!\r\n\r\nWhen you are involved in a traffic accident in Korea\r\nI do not speak Korean. What should I do?\r\nA sudden traffic accident in Korea!\r\nCannot speak Koreanand feeling overwhelmed?\r\nDo not panic, and call Police Emergency 112 right away!\r\n(If anyone is injured, call 119.)\r\nBefore moving the vehicle to a safe place, make sure to take photos and videos of the accident scene from various angles.\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******df820c0-faa6-4fb7-823f-d88f25f3a185.png\" alt=\"This is the police.\r\nIf you call the police, a free foreign language interpretation service will be provided immediately.\r\nPlease explain your current location and situation comfortably in your native language.\r\nI was in a car accident.\r\nI do not speak Korean well.\r\nI will connect you to an interpreter.\r\nPlease wait a moment.\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******3be1c99-20cb-4dbf-ad6c-9058381ef47b.png\" alt=\"Are you hurt anywhere?\r\nPlease show me your passport and international driving permit.\r\nYes.\r\nWhen the police arrive, please present your passport, residence card, and international driving permit.\r\nThe police will assist with the on-site investigation and review the dashcam footage.\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******84b1975-2e3f-4bcc-a715-dba19620e7b7.png\" alt=\"Now, contact your car insurance company.\r\nAfter the police investigation is completed, you may also receive a “Certificate of Traffic Accident Fact.”\r\nThe Korean National Police prioritize your safety above all else.\r\nIf you are involved in an accident, do not hesitate to call 112!\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******9a5060e-3782-460f-af82-0a0fead7f5e3.png\" alt=\"Even if you could not report the accident on the same day, that is okay.\r\nYou can still file a report with the Traffic Investigation Unit.\r\nCan I still file a report?\r\nWhat a relief.\r\nHow to report an accident after leaving the scene\r\nEven if you could not report the accident at the scene, please visit the Traffic Investigation Unit at the relevant police station to file a report.\r\nBefore your visit, please bring the dashcam footage of the accident (USB), your medical certificate, and your passport.\r\nIf you need interpretation assistance, you can receive free legal counseling at the Seoul Foreign Resident Center.\r\nYour medical certificate must include the number of days required for treatment.\">What to Do If You're Involved in a Traffic Accident in Korea* What to Do If You're Involved in a Traffic Accident in Korea① Call 112 → Request the free interpretation service → Explain the situation in your native language② Show your passport or Residence Card (RC)③ Submit dashcam footage and contact your insurance company* Missed Reporting the Accident?Visit the Traffic Investigation Unit at the police station with jurisdiction over the accident site to file a report.": 1,
    "<img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260724145032a005f211-69ae-4929-8bb6-498a6ebf5b1a.png\" alt=\"别担心！\r\n在韩国发生交通事故时\r\n我不会韩语，应该怎么办呢？\r\n在韩国突遇交通事故！\r\n因为不会韩语而不知所措吗？\r\n不要惊慌，请拨打报警电话112！\r\n（如果有人员受伤，请拨打119）\r\n在将车辆移至安全地带之前，务必从各个角度拍摄现场照片和视频留存证据。\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260724145041b01bfe07-4a3b-4288-bd80-276aa07bb332.png\" alt=\"这里是报警中心。\r\n拨打报警电话后，会立即为您接通免费翻译服务。\r\n请用母语说明位置和情况。\r\n我发生了车祸。\r\n我不太会说韩语。\r\n马上为您转接翻译人员，\r\n请稍等。\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******21ea059-89d8-48e3-8e30-fcdaefa05af6.png\" alt=\"有哪里受伤吗？\r\n请出示护照和国际驾照。\r\n好的。\r\n当警察到达现场后，请出示您的护照、外国人登录证、国际驾照。\r\n警察将协助进行现场调查并确认行车记录仪的内容。\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260724145057e1ce73d0-d6ae-46c9-a0****40f73.png\" alt=\"现在联系投保的机动车保险公司就可以了。\r\n警察调查结束后，您还可以领取“交通事故事实确认书”。\r\n韩国警察将大家的安全放在首位。\r\n发生事故时，请不要犹豫，立即拨打112！\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260724145103dcb***fe-b05aa49aa9f8.png\" alt=\"事故当天没能及时报警也没关系。\r\n交通调查组随时都可以受理您的案件。\r\n现在还可以报案吗？\r\n那太好了！\r\n现场未报警事故的受理流程\r\n即使没有在事故现场立即报警，也可以前往辖区警察局的交通调查组进行报案。\r\n去之前请备好事故当时的行车记录仪视频（USB）、医院诊断书和护照。\r\n如需口译或法律咨询服务，请联系首尔外国人居民中心（02-2229-4900）寻求帮助。\r\n开具诊断书时，请务必注明伤情天数。\">在韩国发生交通事故时，请按以下步骤处理！*在韩国发生交通事故时，请按以下步骤处理！① 拨打112 → 接通免费外语翻译服务 → 用母语说明事故情况② 出示护照、外国人登录证等身份证件③ 提交行车记录仪，并联系保险公司*如果事故当天未能报警怎么办？请前往事故发生地辖区警察署交通事故调查科办理报案。（前往前请携带事故当时的行车记录仪视频，医院诊断书，护照等）": 1,
    "<img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260724144810fe6eed5a-4014-462a-b6e7-3914bd07a7e9.png\" alt=\"걱정하지마세요!\r\n한국에서 교통사고가 났을 때 \r\n한국어 못하는데 어떻게 해야하지?\r\n한국에서 갑작스러운 교통사고! 한국어를 못해서 막막하신가요?\r\n당황하지 말고 경찰112로 전화하세요!(부상자가 있다면 119)\r\n차를 안전한 곳으로 이동시키기 전, 반드시 현장을 다양한 각도에서 사진과 \r\n동영상으로 촬영해두세요.\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******1c49713-ff8f-40ec-9d5f-828982c6fba0.png\" alt=\"다치신 곳은 없나요?\r\n여권과 국제운전면허증을 \r\n보여주세요.\r\n네\r\n경찰이 도착하면 여권, 외국인등록증,\r\n국제운전면허증을 제시하세요.\r\n경찰이 현장 조사와 블랙박스 확인을\r\n도와줍니다.\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******7871f95-21ea-4db4-afd8-2f2d33df3d1c.png\" alt=\"이제 가입하신 자동차 보험회사에 \r\n연락하시면 됩니다.\r\n경찰수사가 완료되면 \r\n“교통사고사실확인원”도 발급받을 수 \r\n있습니다.\r\n대한민국 경찰은 여러분의 안전을\r\n최우선으로 생각합니다.\r\n사고가 났을 땐 주저말고 112를 \r\n누르세요!\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******82addb2-2778-4fba-9a46-a740dcc2f7ea.png\" alt=\"사고 당일 신고를 못 하셨어도\r\n괜찮습니다.\r\n여기 교통수사팀에서 언제든 접수할 수 있어요.\r\n아직 제출할 수 있나요? \r\n다행이다.\r\n현장 미신고 사고 접수 절차\r\n사고 현장에서 바로 신고하지 못했어도,\r\n관할 경찰서 교통수사팀에 방문하여 \r\n접수하세요.\r\n방문 전 사고 당시의 블랙박스 영상(USB), 병원 진단서, 여권을 챙기세요.\r\n통역법〮률상담이 필요한 경우 서울외국인주민센터(02-2229-4900)의 도움을 받으세요.\r\n진단서 발급시에는 상해일수가 \r\n표시되어야 합니다.\">한국에서 교통사고가 났을 때 이렇게 대응하세요!*한국에서 교통사고가 났을 때 이렇게 대처하세요!①112에 전화하기 → 외국어 무료 통역 서비스 연결 → 모국어로 상황 설명②여권, 외국인등록증 등 제시③블랙박스 제출 및 보험회사에 연락*만약 사고 당일 신고를 못했다면?관할 경찰서 교통수사팀 방문 후 사고접수(방문 전 사고 당시 블랙박스, 병원 진단서, 여권 등 지참)": 1,
    "<img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******377a84d-733f-4b77-b8d5-efbb55c7598d.png\" alt=\"外国驾驶员必知\r\n五大交通违法行为\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260623171423dac38fa5-3b58-481e-9903-f93f70cb6346.png\" alt=\"1.加塞（违法）掉头\r\n在掉头区域，后方车辆抢先于前方车辆掉头\r\n妨碍前车正常通行的行为，属于违法行为\r\n（根据《道路交通法》第18条第1项，以轿车为基准罚款6万韩元）\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260623171428e3aa***f-a319-7e1778147e2f.png\" alt=\"2. 违法驶入公交专用车道\r\n不符合通行条件的车辆违法驶入公交专用车道\r\n【高速道路】112座及以下客货车，乘员满6人以上方可驶入公交专用车道\r\n（根据《道路交通法》第61条第2项，以客货车为基准罚款7万韩元，扣30分）\r\n【普通道路】只有公交线路车、包车巴士、儿童校车等经许可的客车可以通行\r\n（根据《道路交通法》第15条第3项，以客货车为基准罚款4万韩元，扣10分）\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******f3c8271-74b2-47d8-ac42-30af53aa22e1.png\" alt=\"3.严禁堵塞路口\r\n在交叉路口内车辆拥堵的情况下，违法驶入路口\r\n（根据《道路交通法》第25条第5项，以轿车为基准罚款4万韩元）\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******213d3bb-408e-4521-86c6-b825dc97a088.png\" alt=\"4.严禁违规变道插队\r\n在车辆停止或缓行路段，违规变道插队\r\n（根据《道路交通法》第23条，以轿车为基准罚款3万韩元）\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260623171443d5d58dca-f5f2-400d-a1c6-9a0e6288d0b9.png\" alt=\"5.非紧急情况下违规使用救护车\r\n搭载虚假病人并鸣响警报器属于违法行为\r\n在非紧急用途行驶时鸣响警报器将受到查处\r\n（根据《道路交通法》第29条第6项，以客车为基准罚款7万韩元）\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******c014d44-6cfc-4aba-b524-cac431bdc257.png\" alt=\"了解并遵守韩国交通法规，从小事做起\r\n是守护所有人安全的第一步\">了解并遵守韩国交通法规，从小事做起是守护所有人安全的第一步来源：警察厅": 1,
    "<img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******687ec82-1e3e-4080-8fd3-fa199351e462.png\" alt=\"Five Major Selfish Driving Practices\r\nThat Every Driver Should Know About\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260623171036df4178cf-17c3-4984-9ae6-15ec7a911ae1.png\" alt=\"1. Cutting Ahead During a U-Turn (Illegal U-Turn)\r\nCutting ahead of another vehicle while making a U-turn\r\nThis is a traffic violation if it obstructs or interferes with the vehicle ahead \r\n(Article 18 (1) of the Road Traffic Act, Fine for Passenger Vehicles: KRW 60,000)\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******a075ce0-b133-496c-b928-e7772011c917.png\" alt=\"2. Unauthorized Use of a Bus-Only Lane\r\nUsing a bus-only lane with an unauthorized vehicle\r\n[Expressway] Only vans with 12 seats or fewer that are carrying six or more people may use a bus-only lane (Vehicles carrying fewer than six people may not use the lane)\r\n(Article 61 (2) of the Road Traffic Act, Fine for Vans: KRW 70,000, 30 Demerit Points)\r\n[General Roads] Only authorized passenger vehicles, such as route buses, charter buses, and school buses, may use the bus-only lane\r\n(Article 61 (2) of the Road Traffic Act, Fine for Vans: KRW 40,000, 10 Demerit Points)\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260623171045e26bb18b-1e75-4797-9ff2-a371aafbaf4b.png\" alt=\"3. No Blocking the Intersection\r\nEntering an intersection when traffic is backed up and vehicles cannot move through\r\n(Article 25 (5) of the Road Traffic Act, Fine for Passenger Vehicles: KRW 40,000)\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******f505713-66b5-4576-a0c2-ff8862305de8.png\" alt=\"4. No Illegal Lane Cutting\r\nCutting into a lane where traffic is stopped or moving slowly\r\n(Article 23 of the Road Traffic Act, Fine for Passenger Vehicles: KRW 30,000)\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20260623171054d73d3920-0c1a-45db-8431-367e7320af03.png\" alt=\"5. Illegal Use of a Siren by a Non-Emergency Ambulance\r\nUsing a siren while transporting a false emergency patient\r\nDrivers will be penalized for activating a siren when the vehicle is not being used for an emergency\r\n(Article 29 (6) of the Road Traffic Act, Fine for Vans: KRW 70,000)\"><img src=\"https://global.seoul.go.kr/contents/commoneditor/20******8e6254d-77e0-47cf-8c8b-b8013de194c5.png\" alt=\"Taking the time to understand and follow Korea’s traffic laws\r\nis the first step toward keeping everyone safe\">Taking the time to understand and follow Korea’s traffic lawsis the first step toward keeping everyone safeSource: Korean National Police Agency": 1
